  "prefLabel": "Emp 101.05 Employing unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 101.05 “Employing unit” means “employing unit” as defined in RSA 282-A:7, I. The term includes employer, labor organization, limited liability company and governmental entity.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Emp 100) #10080, eff 1-30-12; renumbered by #10193, INTERIM (from Emp 101.06)",
